{
  "$defs": {
    "AvailabilityDecision": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一次 availability 判定：时间 + availability policy + 证据**或**证据缺口（ADR-0023 §2）。\n\n- `evidence` 与 `evidence_gap` **恰好给出一项**：每个判定要么有来源证据，要么显式记录缺口；\n- `available_time < ingest_time`（早于本机得知）**必须**有证据，不得仅凭 `event_time` 回填；\n- 记录证据缺口时，`available_time` 必须**等于** `ingest_time`（保守回退），不得取更早的时间。\n\n证据缺口不是数据集级失败：该 revision 以 `ingest_time` 为历史可用时间继续参与 PIT，\n缺口随 manifest 绑定（roadmap Phase 1 验收 #18）。\n\n**诚实边界**：证据项只是非空引用；证据是否存在、是否真的支持该时间、policy 是否真的据此算出\n`available_time`，属未来 Registry 与 policy 审阅（roadmap Phase 1 验收 #17）。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.1.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "times": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ObservationTimes"
        },
        "policy": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/PolicyBinding"
        },
        "evidence": {
          "default": [],
          "items": {
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Evidence",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "evidence_gap": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "minLength": 1,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Evidence Gap"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "times",
        "policy"
      ],
      "title": "AvailabilityDecision",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ObservationTimes": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一个 revision 的两轴时间（ADR-0023 §1），全部 UTC，naive 时间拒绝。\n\n六个 ADR 字段：`event_time`、`source_time`、`available_time`、`ingest_time`、\n`knowledge_time`、`declared_latency`。区间型数据（例如 1m bar）按 ADR §1「同时记录区间起止」\n另给 `event_end_time`，即半开区间 `[event_time, event_end_time)` 的结束端；瞬时事件不填。\n\n局部不变量：\n\n- `declared_latency >= 0`（只作用于历史轴的保守计算，不代替任何知识轴时间）；\n- `knowledge_time >= ingest_time`；\n- `available_time` 不早于观察本身可被观察的时刻（瞬时事件取 `event_time`，\n  区间取 `event_end_time`），也不早于已给出的 `source_time`；\n- `source_time` 没有就为空，不得伪造。\n\n`available_time` **可以早于** `ingest_time`（历史 backfill），但那需要证据——\n见 `AvailabilityDecision`。\n`declared_latency` 如何进入 `available_time` 由 availability policy 计算，本模型不重算。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.1.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "event_time": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Event Time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "event_end_time": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "date-time",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Event End Time"
        },
        "source_time": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "date-time",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Source Time"
        },
        "available_time": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Available Time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ingest_time": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Ingest Time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "knowledge_time": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Knowledge Time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "declared_latency": {
          "format": "duration",
          "title": "Declared Latency",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "event_time",
        "available_time",
        "ingest_time",
        "knowledge_time",
        "declared_latency"
      ],
      "title": "ObservationTimes",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "PolicyBinding": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "对一份版本化规则的绑定：`policy_id` + SemVer + 内容哈希（03-data.md §7.3）。\n\n`role` 区分 availability policy、precedence policy、PIT 选择规则与 parser 版本；使用处按字段\n要求确切的 `role`，因此 availability 与 precedence 绑定不能互相冒充。\n\n**诚实边界**：只约束形状。该版本是否已登记、`policy_hash` 是否等于该版本的真实内容、\npolicy 是否带有已审阅的来源证据，属未来 Registry（03-data.md §7.3「标识符冻结 ≠ 数据可信」）。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.1.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "role": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/PolicyRole"
        },
        "policy_id": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_-]*(?:\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_-]*)*$",
          "title": "Policy Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "version": {
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "policy_hash": {
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "title": "Policy Hash",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "role",
        "policy_id",
        "version",
        "policy_hash"
      ],
      "title": "PolicyBinding",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "PolicyRole": {
      "description": "一条绑定所约束的规则类别；同一形状的绑定按类别分别使用、不可互换。",
      "enum": [
        "availability",
        "precedence",
        "point_in_time",
        "parser"
      ],
      "title": "PolicyRole",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "PrecedenceEvidence": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一条持久化的 supersedes 边：`revision_id` 取代 `superseded_revision_id`（ADR-0023 §4）。\n\n由 precedence policy 在 ingest 时产生，或事后追加以解决 competing heads；它只对\n`knowledge_cutoff >= knowledge_time` 的查询生效（ADR-0023 §5 第 4 步）。\n新旧 revision 不得相同；证据至少一项。\n\n**诚实边界**：证据是否真实、policy 是否真的证明了先后，属未来 Registry 与 policy 审阅。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.1.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "observation_key": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Observation Key",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "revision_id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Revision Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "superseded_revision_id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Superseded Revision Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "policy": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/PolicyBinding"
        },
        "evidence": {
          "items": {
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "title": "Evidence",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "knowledge_time": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Knowledge Time",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "observation_key",
        "revision_id",
        "superseded_revision_id",
        "policy",
        "evidence",
        "knowledge_time"
      ],
      "title": "PrecedenceEvidence",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "RevisionRecord": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一个不可变 revision（ADR-0023 §4）：只追加，永不覆盖。\n\n- `observation_key`：同一业务观察的稳定键；`revision_id`：稳定修订身份；`source_id`：来源身份；\n  `payload_hash`：该 payload 的 SHA-256。格式由实施批次按数据类型定义并版本化。\n- `arrival_seq`：本机追加顺序，**只**用于审计、幂等与恢复；**不是**语义优先级，\n  也不得用于打破冲突。\n- `supersedes`：本 revision 取代的 revision 集合（去重、禁止自指；按 ID 规范排序，不表示先后）。\n  允许指向尚未 ingest 的 predecessor（dangling）。\n- `source_revision_id` / `source_revision_time`：来源提供时记录，供 precedence policy 证明先后；\n  来源给出修订时间时，`available_time` 不得早于它（ADR-0023 §2）。\n\n跨记录约束（ID / 序号唯一、边不跨 key、无环、边有证据）只能在 `RevisionGraph` 证明；\n`revision_id` 是否按规则形成、`arrival_seq` 是否跨重启不复用，属未来存储层。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.1.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "observation_key": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Observation Key",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "revision_id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Revision Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "source_id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Source Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "payload_hash": {
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "title": "Payload Hash",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "arrival_seq": {
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Arrival Seq",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "supersedes": {
          "default": [],
          "items": {
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Supersedes",
          "type": "array",
          "uniqueItems": true
        },
        "source_revision_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "minLength": 1,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Source Revision Id"
        },
        "source_revision_time": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "date-time",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Source Revision Time"
        },
        "availability": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/AvailabilityDecision"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "observation_key",
        "revision_id",
        "source_id",
        "payload_hash",
        "arrival_seq",
        "availability"
      ],
      "title": "RevisionRecord",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "一组 revision 与 precedence 证据的聚合校验（ADR-0023 §4）。\n\n边集合 = 各记录声明的 `supersedes` 边 ∪ 全部 `PrecedenceEvidence` 边。聚合不变量：\n\n- `revision_id` 唯一；`arrival_seq` 唯一（只是审计序号的唯一性，不参与任何排序）；\n- 同一 `observation_key` 下 `(source_id, payload_hash)` 唯一：重复 payload 不产生新 revision；\n- `revision_id` 在图内是全局身份，只能属于一个 `observation_key`。统一 claim：记录的\n  `revision_id` 与其全部 `supersedes`（含 dangling）认领该记录的键；每条证据的两端\n  （含 dangling）认领该证据的键。任一 ID 被不同键认领即拒绝——允许 dangling\n  不等于允许其归属自相矛盾；\n- 整个边集合无环（自指已在单条记录 / 证据上拒绝）；\n- 允许 dangling predecessor：被取代的 revision 可以尚未出现在本图中；\n- 记录声明的每条 `supersedes` 边都必须有匹配的 `PrecedenceEvidence`（同键、同两端），\n  且该证据的 `knowledge_time` 不晚于该记录的 `knowledge_time`——否则在两者之间的 cutoff 下，\n  这条可用于选择的边没有证据（03-data.md §7.5 fail closed）。只来自证据的边是事后追加的\n  precedence 记录，天然合法。\n\n校验结果只取决于集合内容，与元组顺序和 `arrival_seq` 的取值无关。本模型**不**执行 PIT 选择：\n候选过滤、传递淘汰与 maximal head 判定属于批次 F 的执行器，其结果形状见 `PointInTimeSelection`。",
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "default": "2.1.0",
      "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "revisions": {
      "default": [],
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/RevisionRecord"
      },
      "title": "Revisions",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "precedence_evidence": {
      "default": [],
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/PrecedenceEvidence"
      },
      "title": "Precedence Evidence",
      "type": "array"
    }
  },
  "title": "RevisionGraph",
  "type": "object"
}
